B.a7d=s(["If everything is right, tap 'Review & release payment' and follow the steps to confirm and sign.","Your held payment is then captured and paid out to the mechanic.","Tap 'Leave a review' to rate the mechanic. Honest reviews help other customers."],t.s)
B.a09=new A.hr(B.a7d)
